msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ah, they have grown to be so "
"beautiful..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫ずいぶん、⟪k:12⟫綺麗に咲いたみた"
"い……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5D915F34_3442_4BDA_9B75_EA6963124549
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71c1677c75ddcc0d8056cf45abd61f191c8ad4cb98b99a2b6d0610b181860b22
#. default-sha256: 9965a0e51e459d99e297cad9d1b44f4c9d2431b5e0411cfc766092ee01af260d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5D915F34_3442_4BDA_9B75_EA6963124549"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Such a wonderful fragrance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The scent of roses is so calming.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wonder why "
"that is..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫良い香りね。⟪k:1⟫……どうしてかしら、⟪k:2⟫薔薇の匂いを嗅ぐと、⟪k:3⟫こんなにも落ち着くのは……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D68FB132_36D1_43CB_8AC1_FBDE0EF33E34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca9aa376916cade40bda68f7d24f4742d0e08b0fd4bc667c77e92a4da6d72d06
#. default-sha256: 688a15ad94ee3f9616df0735645f582c393e20728140efc68d0348dde671dd19
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D68FB132_36D1_43CB_8AC1_FBDE0EF33E34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Would it cause any trouble if I picked one?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……一本、⟪k:1⟫手折っても大丈夫かしら。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B7634D2_4B4F_4508_8561_EF1B27F9F49C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f36675478a6d6afd05cff6e593690b961b315f53986f9cc57375b375971aaf91
#. default-sha256: 81131a8e0b383cdd33e586f81f3e6b98a33f5353e7e11c4debe05e8cbeac22e5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B7634D2_4B4F_4508_8561_EF1B27F9F49C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, hello there. Out for a midnight stroll, are you?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Quite the peculiar "
"hobby... ⟪k:4⟫“Madam”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫まあ、⟪k:2⟫夜のお散歩ですか。⟪k:3⟫変わった趣味をなさっているんですね。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫―――“奥さ"
"ま”？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5A3AB145_58BD_41A4_8A2F_2FB5A8C21D76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 594e330f9bd7c5c4cd427dce1dff92e70aff73976c968c492a8b788560ecb09d
#. default-sha256: 5bd402da12078a0176635fe74318a4708656d378e85b94e7bdd60607c2e74df4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5A3AB145_58BD_41A4_8A2F_2FB5A8C21D76"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫U-⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Um, ⟪k:5⟫I cannot spend as much time as I would like outside during "
"the day, so I end up coming out at night...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I apologize if I startled you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あ……。⟪k:3⟫あの、⟪k:4⟫夜じゃないと満足に出歩けないので、⟪k:5⟫つい……。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫驚か"
"せてしまいましたね。⟪k:8⟫ごめんなさい。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F04C7A2F_4D50_486F_B1A4_9A351110B7F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a1324ce2dfbf6667812c1c68f564b62bafb26e827c1485986f0eb414aac2933
#. default-sha256: 354c8301768376cfcc7b68b39b3ea84c99415e6d4508a1a2acaa1e29e0859711
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F04C7A2F_4D50_486F_B1A4_9A351110B7F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh no, not at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫いえ、⟪k:2⟫とんでもありません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_89149FFE_056C_40EC_AA10_89D8B6933C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5f9ea4f92141964342597a39e2dd388101fc1b482e9187973ebca913cdc3c58
#. default-sha256: 96f8920cacfd977c9c73b59819de03be001fc19480293302c209a247e6e7c050
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_89149FFE_056C_40EC_AA10_89D8B6933C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is a chilling, captivating beauty to the sight of your snow-white form standing "
"there in the moonlit garden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫夜の薔薇園に浮かぶ純白のあなたは、⟪k:2⟫背筋が凍るほど美しくて……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫わたくし、⟪k:5⟫"
"見惚れるほどでございましたわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_457BC5E0_624E_43E9_B1BB_AF87D2552128
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a54618fa52dc3082164459c0ae75bf5b313b5dad2814dd66639cb31939b9580
#. default-sha256: 5afe69b39175fc3bfde27b466ab3e7b43e2b162d952bb64b473546a06f2bbc4c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_457BC5E0_624E_43E9_B1BB_AF87D2552128"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would hardly...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Um, ⟪k:4⟫what are you doing out so late?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そんな……。⟪k:2⟫でも、⟪k:3⟫あなたも、⟪k:4⟫どうしてこんな夜更けに？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_654A59B7_5584_42CD_9134_31C48EE1A8E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8970fe69435b2a2585cec5ae22196ae2f3117c82c1ec8a8cebf670eb492643b
#. default-sha256: dbd2611b5d2c89a315f1eb5c1bb28ec7a3463bba2abaf459ca74730295575083
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_654A59B7_5584_42CD_9134_31C48EE1A8E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I saw a figure through the window.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫On the slight chance it might be a burglar,"
"⟪k:4⟫I thought it my responsibility to ensure they did not break in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫人影が見えたものですから。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫万が一夜盗の類でも紛れ込んでしまったら、⟪k:4⟫大変で"
"ございましょう？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4935B276_EA74_4831_A52A_A645C452BEFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 845c0070c2cd4955d9a335280c1de47c21e754badc215037cacfec1f8534bdc5
#. default-sha256: 8031db0ccd19eec33b804d9a8f5ad51ba8a87a2d9795311faf7dd79e7f483bf8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4935B276_EA74_4831_A52A_A645C452BEFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was also the middle of the night when the grocer’s servant broke into their safe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……食料品屋の奉公人も金庫をこじ開けたのは深夜なんですのよ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_34E7DCF2_024B_4C97_9867_2F839ECB2D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0271c6a9c93b9ac13448eeccd73c581ee6054b1aa55bcf8b6f66cafad1d36913
