msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Y-⟪k:2⟫Yes. ⟪k:3⟫I was thinking about giving it to my husband."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……は、⟪k:2⟫はい。⟪k:3⟫主人に渡そうと思いまして。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D451EF29_CB72_4698_80BB_220487F7C951
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ac548af1962b66efaeddf6aa5777a0e15ba6084ee43317fc2590e3e3739a208
#. default-sha256: 5e25b13515bdedc44f53345051faa91a3402cb5beeaaa9962211c83ead9c9b9b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D451EF29_CB72_4698_80BB_220487F7C951"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫While I expect he has little fondness for such feminine tastes,⟪k:2⟫the scent of "
"flowers has a truly calming effect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あの人、⟪k:2⟫こういう女性的なものは嫌うかもしれませんけど……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫でも、⟪k:5⟫お花の"
"香りは、⟪k:6⟫心を落ち着けます。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_80E6097D_BFF6_4A01_8208_FD02904C8D07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed70f886b8108215e986ffba1057f4460a77899059472bd0b642b166a111ed7d
